    "searchCoverage": "Official Autotask REST Username/Secret/APIIntegrationcode headers, ZoneInformation discovery, entityInformation and record GETs, Kaseya/Datto identity, and dated July 2021 Kaseya VSA REvil coverage reviewed on 2026-09-13. Pinned OpenConnector computes the zone REST host from GET /zoneInformation?user= and stores it as credential metadata. Official entity APIs are served from webservicesN.autotask.net, prde.autotask.net, and pres.autotask.net. ZoneInformation itself is unauthenticated and is not a cheap authenticated healthcheck. Algolia bounded-wildcard + required stored id does not apply because the zone is computed from the username rather than a user-supplied product id.",
